{
  "uid": "ee9ep4jxtwkcgf",
  "title": "Backtest execution",
  "description": "Inspect one backtest run. CLI and GetExperiment deep-link here as ?var-execution= only; var-backtest is not required. The backtest selector is set from that run. Once that execution is known, from and to are its exact earliest and latest timestamps (no pad). Saved time now/now is not kept. The link does not need from or to. Worker arguments are the values stored for the run. Latest portfolio value, return, max drawdown, and Sharpe are stats. Portfolio value is the equity curve. Drawdown is underwater on its own axis. Returns are bars.",
